---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') 
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1) 
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section id="via-hero" class="via-hero-section">
  <!-- Ambient Glow & Clinical Backdrop -->
  <div class="hero-background-canvas" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hero-clinical-bg-stage">
      <img 
        src={`${baseUrl}/assets/via-hero-bg.jpg?v=1`} 
        alt="Consulta pediátrica con estación clínica mostrando análisis acústico y audiometría junto a especialista y paciente" 
        class="clinical-artwork-img"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <div class="clinical-overlay-gradient"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="glow-orb orb-cyan"></div>
    <div class="glow-orb orb-blue"></div>
    <div class="glow-orb orb-emerald"></div>
    <div class="hero-grid-pattern"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container hero-content-wrapper">
    <!-- Top Intro Block -->
    <div class="hero-top-intro">
      <div class="via-app-icon-wrapper">
        <img 
          src={`${baseUrl}/assets/via-logo.png`} 
          alt="Logo Oficial de VIA+ (SaMD Clase IIa)" 
          class="via-brand-icon" 
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="editorial-eyebrow eyebrow-cyan">
        <span>Equipamiento Clínico Llave en Mano · SaMD Clase IIa (MDR 2017/745)</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-headline">
        Valoración interactiva de audición, voz y lenguaje: <span class="gradient-text-cyan">SaMD llave en mano y 100% offline</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-narrative-lead">
        Software como Dispositivo Médico (<strong>SaMD Clase IIa · MDR 2017/745</strong>) entregado preconfigurado sobre <strong>tableta clínica homologada en modo kiosco</strong> con calibración electroacústica sellada de fábrica. Incluye <strong>13 módulos gamificados</strong>, análisis acústico validado frente a estándares de fonética clínica, soporte en <strong>7 variedades lingüísticas</strong> y <strong>motor NLG determinista</strong> para informes bajo supervisión facultativa.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-badge-pill-row">
        <span class="badge-pill pill-cyan">⚕️ SaMD Clase IIa · MDR 2017/745</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-purple">🛡️ Estación Homologada Llave en Mano</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-emerald">🧾 Motor NLG Determinista</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-amber">⚡ Cero IA de Caja Negra · 100% Offline</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-cta-group">
        <button type="button" data-open-contact class="btn-via-primary">
          <span>Solicitar Demostración Clínica</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <a href="#modulos" class="btn-via-secondary">
          <span>Explorar los 13 Módulos</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#que-es-via" class="btn-via-secondary">
          <span>Sistema Llave en Mano</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Showcase Grid: 3 Clinical Pillars + Real Tablet Mockup -->
    <div class="via-showcase-grid">
      <div class="showcase-cards-col">
        <div class="via-feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge icon-cyan">🎙️</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>Calibración en Cámara Anecoica &amp; Audiometría</strong>
            <p>Curva electroacústica sellada de fábrica frente a sonómetro Clase 1, control de ruido ambiental en dB(A) y audiometría tonal y condicionada.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="via-feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge icon-purple">🔬</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>Biomarcadores de Voz, Hitos ASHA &amp; Cribado Clínico</strong>
            <p>Extracción de frecuencia fundamental, perturbación vocal y formantes, junto con cribado normativo ASHA (0 a 5 años), disfagia MECV-V, SAHS y M-CHAT-R/F.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="via-feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge icon-emerald">🧾</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>Informes con Motor NLG Determinista y 7 Lenguas</strong>
            <p>Síntesis clínica combinatoria sin alucinaciones con cálculo de pérdida auditiva (BIAP/OMS), borrador editable por el especialista, firma colegiada y 7 lenguas de sesión.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-tablet-col">
        <div class="tablet-frame-mockup">
          <div class="tablet-status-bar">
            <span class="tablet-notch"></span>
            <span class="tablet-tag">VIA+ SaMD · Estación en Modo Kiosco</span>
          </div>
          <img 
            src={`${baseUrl}/assets/via-app-clean.png`} 
            alt="Captura real del módulo clínico de VIA+ SaMD con Análisis Acústico de Voz y Audiometría" 
            class="tablet-capture-img"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .via-hero-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 8.5rem 0 5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--bg-dark);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-background-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-clinical-bg-stage {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 2;
    opacity: 0.55;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .clinical-artwork-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%, black 35%, transparent 85%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%, black 35%, transparent 85%);
    filter: brightness(0.55) contrast(1.15);
  }

  .clinical-overlay-gradient {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 35%, rgba(7, 9, 14, 0.35) 0%, rgba(7, 9, 14, 0.88) 72%, var(--bg-dark) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .glow-orb {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(95px);
    opacity: 0.25;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .orb-cyan {
    top: 10%;
    left: 15%;
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-cyan) 0%, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0) 70%);
  }

  .orb-blue {
    bottom: 10%;
    right: 12%;
    width: 460px;
    height: 460px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-blue) 0%, rgba(79, 172, 254, 0) 70%);
  }

  .orb-emerald {
    top: 50%;
    left: 45%;
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-emerald) 0%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0) 70%);
    opacity: 0.16;
  }

  .hero-grid-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, black 30%, transparent 80%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, black 30%, transparent 80%);
  }

  .hero-content-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .hero-top-intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }

  .via-app-icon-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem auto;
  }

  .via-brand-icon {
    width: clamp(80px, 10vw, 100px);
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 24px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 35px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.45)) drop-shadow(0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6));
    border: 2px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
    background: #0f172a;
    animation: subtleFloat 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes subtleFloat {
    0% { transform: translateY(0px); }
    100% { transform: translateY(-6px); }
  }

  .editorial-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .eyebrow-cyan {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.2vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.16;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
  }

  .gradient-text-cyan {
    color: #38BDF8;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.55);
  }

  .hero-narrative-lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.6vw, 1.22rem);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem auto;
  }

  .hero-narrative-lead strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .hero-badge-pill-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .badge-pill {
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .pill-cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .pill-purple {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
    color: #D8B4FE;
  }

  .pill-emerald {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
    color: var(--accent-emerald);
  }

  .pill-amber {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    color: #FCD34D;
  }

  .hero-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-via-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.95rem 2.1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan) 0%, var(--accent-blue) 100%);
    color: #040914;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: inherit;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 25px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .btn-via-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 35px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.6);
  }

  .btn-via-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.95rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .btn-via-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* Showcase Grid */
  .via-showcase-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .showcase-cards-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .via-feature-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .via-feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
  }

  .feature-icon-badge {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .icon-cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
  }

  .icon-purple {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
  }

  .icon-emerald {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
  }

  .feature-text strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .feature-text p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .showcase-tablet-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .tablet-frame-mockup {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 60px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 35px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .tablet-status-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .tablet-notch {
    width: 44px;
    height: 4px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .tablet-tag {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .tablet-capture-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 18px;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .via-showcase-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .via-hero-section {
      padding: 6.5rem 0 3.5rem 0;
    }
    .hero-headline {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 6vw, 2.2rem);
    }
    .btn-via-primary, .btn-via-secondary {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
